I found the string tension at β = 2.3, 2.4 and 2.5, and plaquette values only at nearby couplings. I also found continuum and scale-matched scalar glueball values, but not at fixed β. Web search was refused, so I used only arXiv PDFs.

**Control:** I₂(1)/I₁(1) = 0.240194, written to `control.txt`.

