|---|---|---|
| a√σ at β = 2.3 / 2.4 / 2.5 | FOUND | 0.3690(30) / 0.2660(20) / 0.1905(8) (Fingberg–Heller–Karsch hep-lat/9208012, Table 3) |
| a√σ at β = 2.2, 2.6, 2.7 | FOUND | 0.4690(100), 0.1360(40), 0.1015(10) (same table) |
